{"id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-nce.md","title":"有限差分与 omega-c.e. 集合","display":"df-nce — 有限差分与 omega-c.e. 集合","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-nce","aliases":["20-df-nce"],"display":"df-nce — 有限差分与 omega-c.e. 集合","chapter":"3","section":"3.8","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.8.6","source_pdf_pages":[111,112],"source_printed_pages":[75,76],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-computable]]","[[20-df-characteristic]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-nce"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-nce</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nce — 有限差分与 omega-c.e. 集合"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.8.6"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\omega^2\\to2\">\\(a:\\omega^2\\to2\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ea4f6c0d21b23194\" href=\"?note=ea4f6c0d21b23194\" title=\"20-df-computable-approximation\">20-df-computable-approximation</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>。</p>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{tot}\">\\(\\mathrm{tot}\\)</span> 表示全定义限制：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\">\\(\\mathcal C_k^{\\mathrm{tot}}=\\{f\\in\\mathcal C_k:\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\omega^k\\}\\)</span>；相对族采用同一限制。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"de14d8d6c42250de\" href=\"?note=de14d8d6c42250de\" title=\"20-df-characteristic\">20-df-characteristic</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nce}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Approx}_0(a,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ a(x,0)=0)\\land a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nCE}(A,n)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in2^{\\omega^2}\\\n[\\operatorname{Approx}_0(a,A)\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n|\\{s\\in\\omega:a(x,s+1)\\ne a(x,s)\\}|\\le n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{OmegaCE}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in2^{\\omega^2}\\ \\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\operatorname{Approx}_0(a,A)\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n|\\{s\\in\\omega:a(x,s+1)\\ne a(x,s)\\}|\\le b(x)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DCE}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B,C\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A=B\\setminus C].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nce}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{Approx}_0(a,A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow a\\in\\mathcal C_2^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\n(\\forall x\\in\\omega\\ a(x,0)=0)\\land a\\rightsquigarrow\\chi_A,\\\\\n\\operatorname{nCE}(A,n)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in2^{\\omega^2}\\\n[\\operatorname{Approx}_0(a,A)\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n|\\{s\\in\\omega:a(x,s+1)\\ne a(x,s)\\}|\\le n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{OmegaCE}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists a\\in2^{\\omega^2}\\ \\exists b\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\\n[\\operatorname{Approx}_0(a,A)\\land\\forall x\\in\\omega\\\n|\\{s\\in\\omega:a(x,s+1)\\ne a(x,s)\\}|\\le b(x)],\\\\\n\\operatorname{DCE}(A)\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists B,C\\in\\mathcal E\\ [A=B\\setminus C].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>0-c.e. 集合只有空集；1-c.e. 恰为 c.e.；2-c.e. 恰为两个 c.e. 集合之差。起始值条件不能省略，否则级别的名称会改变。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.8.6；印刷页 75, 76；PDF 第 111, 112 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-approximation","status":"resolved","id":"ea4f6c0d21b23194","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-approximation]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location